From 513cfb7df58ace89560fd198959dbbc74eeaf0a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ivory <contact@ivory.cafe>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 19:27:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] Route configured walks through DexCache discovery

Add the Fusion namespace selector and feed DexCache class definitions into the existing bounded ClassLoaderWalk and capture flow, allowing targeted namespaces to be recovered without legacy global traversal.

Constraint: Keep discovery in the framework-to-ART bridge and preserve the existing worker and capture budgets.
Rejected: Direct legacy DexFile dumping from Framework | It would bypass ART capture and output ownership.
Confidence: high
Scope-risk: moderate
Directive: Keep new walk sources read-only, bounded, and filtered before reflection.
Tested: r0dump_f7_class_loader_walk_source_test.py; git diff --check.
Not-tested: Full framework build; lunch release configuration is unavailable in this checkout.
Change-Id: Ia5c5af1f16eda8556ddde662dfc30e14f2b8d2a6
